    <fr:route>sss-0021.xml</fr:route>
    <fr:title text="Internal Finiteness">Internal Finiteness</fr:title>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <fr:p>Define a grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> to be <fr:em>finite</fr:em> (or perhaps <fr:em>subfinite</fr:em>) if it is a subobject of grammar of finite cardinals.

<fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[A \hookrightarrow  \mathsf {Fin}]]></fr:tex>

Where <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {Fin}]]></fr:tex> is defined as follows.</fr:p>
    <fr:tree show-metadata="false">
      <fr:frontmatter>
        <fr:authors>
          <fr:author>
            <fr:link href="stevenschaefer.xml" title="Steven Schaefer" addr="stevenschaefer" type="local">Steven Schaefer</fr:link>
          </fr:author>
        </fr:authors>
        <fr:date>
          <fr:year>2025</fr:year>
          <fr:month>2</fr:month>
          <fr:day>12</fr:day>
        </fr:date>
        <fr:addr>sss-001Y</fr:addr>
        <fr:route>sss-001Y.xml</fr:route>
        <fr:title text="A Grammar of Finite Cardinals">A Grammar of Finite Cardinals</fr:title>
        <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <fr:p>Define a grammar for each finite cardinal <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[n : \mathbb {N}]]></fr:tex>.</fr:p>
        <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[ [0] \colonequals  \bot  ]]></fr:tex>
        <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[ [\mathsf {suc}(n)] \colonequals  \top  \oplus  [ n ]]]></fr:tex>
        <fr:p>Then define the grammar of all finite cardinals as
<fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[\mathsf {Fin} \colonequals  \textstyle \mathchoice {\textstyle \oplus _{{\mathopen {}\left (n : \mathbb {N}\right )\mathclose {}}}}{\textstyle \oplus _{{\mathopen {}\left (n : \mathbb {N}\right )\mathclose {}}}}{\scriptstyle \oplus _{{\mathopen {}\left (n : \mathbb {N}\right )\mathclose {}}}}{\scriptscriptstyle \oplus _{{\mathopen {}\left (n : \mathbb {N}\right )\mathclose {}}}}. [n]]]></fr:tex></fr:p>
      </fr:mainmatter>
    </fr:tree>
  </fr:mainmatter>
